{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一名內地旅客偷運犬隻入境被捕。<br/></p><p>海關昨日在落馬洲支線管制站，截查一名55歲內地女子，在其行李內檢獲一隻懷疑非法進口活犬，約值1.5萬元，案件轉交漁農自然護理署跟進調查。</p><p></p><p>根據《狂犬病規例》，非法輸入動物或動物產品等，最高可判罰款五萬元及監禁一年。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:22:54.296915+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T09:38:02.044019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:18:03.641651+00:00","content_hash":"482d0699c58e782cd8fe7a63524ec1c8c12542173a4c40e4b96d4eb7f2c7a388","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}